v2.0
---------------
 * Rewritten. Every limit grows on demand by default, nothing has to be configured
 * New limits: SA LOD render lists, invisible entity lists, alpha lists, stored shadows, point and bright lights, shiny texts, particles, model stores for all three games, handling.cfg entries, collision buffer for all three games, cutscene directory, SA quadtree, env map and vehicle struct pools
 * Ped and vehicle pools also raise the checks outside the pool code
 * Streaming memory "auto" depends on whether the exe is large address aware
 * Limits another mod already changed are left alone, see the log
 * Built with Visual Studio 2026

v1.5
---------------
 * Added coronas and static shadows limits
 * Added ScriptSearchLight limit
 * Unlimited _TimeModels_ for III/VC
 * Fixed _Task = unlimited_ crashing
 * Other bugfixes

v1.4.2
---------------
 * Added unlimited IDE definitions _(still limited by our little ids)_
 * Fixed VisibleEntiesPtrs / VisibleLodPtrs not growing correctly possibly causing a crash
 * Fixed limits information (F5) having wrong wrapx


v1.4:
---------------
 * All the limits usage can be checked by pressing F5 in game _(SA-only for now)_
   + The key can be changed at the ini
 * The *unlimited* concept has been added
   + Most of the already implemented limits can be unlimited _(SA-only for now)_
 * Other fixes and improvements

